<title>USA: Moovies Q1 operating net decreases.</title>
<headline>Moovies Q1 operating net decreases.</headline>
<dateline>GREENVILLE, S.C. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended March 31,</p>
<p>						   1997		1996</p>
<p>							   (in thousands)</p>
<p> Revenue					26,590	   19,316</p>
<p> Income before extraordinary item	  201		623</p>
<p>Extraordinary item -- loss on early</p>
<p>   extinguishment of debt		    229		---</p>
<p> Net income (loss)			    (28)		623</p>
<p>Net income per share:</p>
<p> Income before extraordinary item	  .02		.07</p>
<p>Extraordinary item -- loss on early</p>
<p>   extinguishment of debt		  (.02)		---</p>
<p> Net income					---		.07</p>
<p> Weighted average shares outstanding  12,192	    8,976</p>
<p>NOTE: Moovies Inc said its net income for the first quarter of 1997 before extraordinary charge for a loss on early extinguishment of debt, was $201,000, or $0.02 per share, for the first quarter of 1997 compared to $623,000, or $0.07 per share, for the first quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>Net for the first quarter of 1997 after taking a $229,000 extraordinary charge for a loss on early extinguishment of debt was a loss of $28,000.</p>
